                    // The bit_offset_in_byte approach is better.
                    // If bpp=1, x=0 -> bit_offset=7, x=1 -> bit_offset=6...
                    // If bpp=4, x=0 -> bit_offset=4, x=1 -> bit_offset=0...
                    // This logic works for both.

